  "name": "arboria_toml",
  "notes": "input.toml is the text of arboria.toml (null = no file); the file is shown as /repo/arboria.toml in messages. Output is the normalized ProjectConfig: fail_patterns as pattern strings (compiled with Python `re`), run.command split with shlex.split, wandb.run_url_r001 = run_url('<project_id or p>-r001'). Invalid-TOML and invalid-regex cases are left out (their messages come from tomllib / re).",
